{"kind":"request","text":"Claude: stop TestActionablePollStillDeclinesAfterSeveralUnrelatedEvents panicking the suite under load.\n\nhugh approved filing this on 2026-10-16.\n\ninternal/service/wait_filter_test.go:184-206@5876d211 starts a goroutine that appends three unrelated events, 300 ms apart, through appendUnrelated(t, …). The test then waits up to 2 s and returns without joining the goroutine. Under load the appends outlive the test, and a t.Fatal inside appendUnrelated after the test has returned panics the whole package: \"panic: Fail in goroutine after TestActionablePollStillDeclinesAfterSeveralUnrelatedEvents has completed\". Three independent full-suite runs hit this on 2026-10-16, at load averages 12 to 34, in the reviews of lanes bb5f2acd and dd845a00. Each time the package passed when run alone.\n\nThere is a second problem. If load delays the appends past the 2 s wait, the test passes without any unrelated event having arrived, so it proves nothing.\n\nOutcome. The test never fails or panics after it returns. It passes only when all three unrelated events were appended before the poll answered.","body":{"conditions":"1. The appending goroutine is joined before the test returns, and its errors are reported from the test goroutine, never from inside the goroutine with t.Fatal. 2. The test asserts that all three unrelated events were appended before the poll answered (or arranges that they are, for example by appending before the deadline under its own control), so a slow machine cannot make it pass vacuously. 3. A mutation that drops the join or the append-before-answer check is shown to break the test, or to reproduce the panic under go test -count=20 with GOMAXPROCS=1 or an artificial delay. 4. The same pattern is checked for elsewhere in internal/service (goroutines calling t.Fatal or t.Error via helpers) and fixed or reported. 5. go test ./... passes at the head.","target_head":"5876d2118fa3d9d223dfc923744bc0bb9ef1dfc0","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8","to":"a5d35aa7e4799472a208663d7f024917442bd513929f9eccf450628ccf70095d"}}